# portal.portal made ideal for comparison: the frame on rigid feet, a rigid
# head; the drives, the bus and the bridge's racking as in portal.portal.
# What's left of the path error is the planner and the servo loops.
drive y1 y.conf sim.txt 60.96
drive y2 y.conf sim.txt 60.96
drive x x.conf sim.txt 60.96
origin 500 500
stroke -5 1005 -5 1005
frame 600 200 400 400 400 0.05
rails 1.2
bridge 30 3.6
carriage 5 0.02
racking 2e5 0.02
head 7 0.02 1500 1500 1500 0.03
guidey 25 30
guidex 15 15
bus 1410 230 1.0
home 500 500
